Package: opencode-v2
Version: 2.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: glibc, clang, patchelf, curl, tar, ca-certificates, bash, coreutils
Section: ai
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://opencode.ai/v2/
Description: OpenCode 2 AI coding agent for Termux (glibc version)
 OpenCode 2 is the next generation AI coding agent from OpenCode.
 This package installs the official linux-arm64 or linux-x64 binary and
 provides the opencode-v2 command, alongside the opencode command from OpenCode 1.
